  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed outdoor seating area, by reason of its position, size and design, would be an inappropriate and unneighbourly development on Barley Mow Passage, has a serious and adverse effect on the amenities enjoyed by adjoining residents, by reason of noise and anti-social behaviour without mitigation, contrary to London Plan policies D3, D14, Local Plan policies CC1; CC2, and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed outdoor seating area, by reason of its position, size, design and operation hours would be an intrusive and inappropriate development on Barley Mow Passage, negative affect the local transport network and infringe the rights of other businesses, vehicle users and pedestrians to use the road, contrary to London Plan policy D3, T4, Local Plan policy CC1, CC2, EC2, and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework."
  ],
